  "description": "Geum Aji doesn’t want to be secretary to young, handsome CEO Cha Do-hwan. She’s been forced into the job by her uncle, and her parents have explicitly forbidden her from resigning voluntarily. Meanwhile, Do-hwan doesn’t want quirky, honest Geum Aji as his secretary, but he has his own reasons for not being able to fire her. Things get even more complicated when they have a drunken one night stand on Aji’s first day at work. Aji wants to be fired. Do-hwan wants her to resign. Who will be the one to give in first? Or will they give in to an entirely different kind of desire? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
